.TH THUMTOO-GC 1 "2026-09-16" "thumtoo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thumtoo-gc \- manual Store maintenance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thumtoo-gc
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manual maintenance for the redesign Store (no automatic eviction). Can target
URIs or paths, print a store summary, list orphans, or operate under a URI
prefix. Prefer
.B \-\-dry\-run
before destructive actions.
.PP
Legacy schema-4 flags were removed; on-disk
.B legacy/
trees are left untouched by Client.
.PP
See
.B \-\-help
for the full option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo (7),
.BR thumtoo-status (1),
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1)
